{"seq":3,"slug":"potential-theory-in-practice","title":"应用与边界：从边界元法到图上的调和函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/potential-theory/practice/potential-theory-in-practice","wordCount":1654,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"应用与边界-从边界元法到图上的调和函数\">应用与边界：从边界元法到图上的调和函数</h1><p>前面把位势论讲成了一门优美的连续数学。可工程师要的是数字：给定一个真实的天线、船体或电路板，边界形状千奇百怪、没有闭式 Green 函数，怎么把电势、流场真正算出来？与此同时，位势论早已越过它十九世纪的物理疆界，渗进了图论、机器学习、随机几何、多复变。本篇收束全 hub，讲三件事：如何数值求解位势问题、位势论如何在当代算法里重生、以及它与相邻领域的边界在哪里。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三类数值方法\">核心概念：三类数值方法</h2><p>把连续的位势问题变成有限的线性代数，主流有三条路线，各有适用场景。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>离散对象</th>\n<th>未知量规模</th>\n<th>适合场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>有限差分/有限元（FDM/FEM）</td>\n<td>整个体积网格</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mi>n</mi></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>有源、非齐次介质、复杂系数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>边界元法（BEM）</td>\n<td>仅边界网格</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^{n-1})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>无源、无界域、光滑边界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蒙特卡洛（行走）</td>\n<td>随机路径</td>\n<td>无网格</td>\n<td>单点求值、超高维</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>边界元法</strong>（Boundary Element Method）是位势论最&quot;本命&quot;的数值方法：既然 <a href=\"../boundary/green-functions\">Green 表示公式</a> 已把内部解写成边界积分，就只需在边界上离散。用 <a href=\"../capacity/newtonian-potential\">牛顿位势</a> 里的单/双层位势把 Dirichlet/Neumann 问题化为边界上的积分方程，未知量只分布在边界（降一维），且天然处理无界外域（无需截断远场）——这对天线辐射、声散射、无限大地基的弹性问题是巨大优势。</p>\n<h2 id=\"快速多极算法-把-o-n-压到-o-n\">快速多极算法：把 O(N²) 压到 O(N)</h2><p>BEM 的软肋是它的矩阵是<strong>稠密</strong>的：每个边界元通过 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 核与所有其它元耦合，直接求解需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 存储、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N^3)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 分解。1987 年 Greengard 与 Rokhlin 的<strong>快速多极算法</strong>（Fast Multipole Method, FMM）解决了这个瓶颈，被公认为二十世纪十大算法之一。</p>\n<p>核心思想纯粹是位势论：一群远处的源，对观测点的合并影响可用少数几个<strong>多极展开</strong>系数近似——因为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/|x-y|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>y</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≪</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|y|\\ll|x|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≪</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 时能按球谐函数展开、快速收敛。把空间八叉树分层，近场直接算、远场用多极近似合并，总复杂度降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。据 Liu 等人的《Fast Multipole Boundary Element Method》综述，配合 FMM 的 BEM 已能在桌面机上求解边界上数百万未知量的位势、弹性、Stokes 流与声波问题（<a href=\"https://www.cambridge.org/core/books/fast-multipole-boundary-element-method/E522EB3361A4E033DCBD323F14F67ECE\">Cambridge University Press, 2009</a>），并已扩展到 GPU 加速的三维气泡动力学等大规模仿真（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/1905.01341\">arXiv:1905.01341</a>）。FMM 今天是分子动力学、天体 N 体、电磁仿真的标准引擎。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  PROB[位势边值问题] --&gt; REP[Green 表示&lt;br/&gt;化为边界积分]&#10;  REP --&gt; DISC[边界元离散&lt;br/&gt;稠密矩阵 O N²]&#10;  DISC --&gt; FMM[快速多极 FMM&lt;br/&gt;多极展开分层合并]&#10;  FMM --&gt; LIN[O N 求解]&#10;  PROB --&gt; WOS[行走随机球 WoS&lt;br/&gt;Kakutani 蒙特卡洛]&#10;  PROB --&gt; GRAPH[图 Laplacian&lt;br/&gt;离散调和]&#10;  GRAPH --&gt; ML[半监督学习&lt;br/&gt;标签传播]\">flowchart TD\n  PROB[位势边值问题] --&gt; REP[Green 表示&lt;br/&gt;化为边界积分]\n  REP --&gt; DISC[边界元离散&lt;br/&gt;稠密矩阵 O N²]\n  DISC --&gt; FMM[快速多极 FMM&lt;br/&gt;多极展开分层合并]\n  FMM --&gt; LIN[O N 求解]\n  PROB --&gt; WOS[行走随机球 WoS&lt;br/&gt;Kakutani 蒙特卡洛]\n  PROB --&gt; GRAPH[图 Laplacian&lt;br/&gt;离散调和]\n  GRAPH --&gt; ML[半监督学习&lt;br/&gt;标签传播]</pre><h2 id=\"概率数值法-行走随机球\">概率数值法：行走随机球</h2><p><a href=\"brownian-connection\">布朗运动的概率联系</a> 不只是理论，它直接给出一个数值方法——<strong>行走随机球</strong>（Walk on Spheres, WoS）。要在单点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 求 Dirichlet 解 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>τ</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u(x)=\\mathbb{E}_x[g(B_\\tau)]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span>，无需网格：从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span> 画最大内切球，跳到球面随机一点（均匀分布，因 Poisson 核在球心均匀），重复直到接近边界，读取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 值，多次平均即得。它天然无网格、可并行、对高维和复杂边界鲁棒，近年在计算机图形学（Monte Carlo 几何处理）中复兴，用于渲染、扩散曲线、热方法测地距离——直接把 Kakutani 公式变成产品级算法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"离散位势论-图-laplacian-与机器学习\">离散位势论：图 Laplacian 与机器学习</h2><p>把连续 Laplace 算子换成<strong>图 Laplacian</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L=D-W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span> 度矩阵、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>W</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span></span> 权重矩阵），整套位势论就搬到了图上。图上&quot;调和函数&quot;即满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Lu=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Lu</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>（每个内部节点的值等于邻居加权平均）的函数——正是 <a href=\"../foundations/mean-value-maximum\">均值性质与极值原理</a> 里 Koebe 逆定理的离散版。</p>\n<p>这直接支撑了半监督学习的经典方法。Zhu、Ghahramani 与 Lafferty 提出的<strong>高斯场与调和函数</strong>方法，把标签函数建模为图上的高斯随机场，其均值最小化二次能量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></msup><mi>L</mi><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u^\\top L u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">⊤</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Lu</span></span></span></span></span>（Dirichlet 能量的离散版），已标注节点作为&quot;边界值&quot;钳定，未标注节点取调和延拓——本质是在图上解一个 Dirichlet 问题（<a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/publication/280306983_An_overview_on_the_Gaussian_Fields_and_Harmonic_Functions_Method_for_Semi-supervised_Learning\">概述见 ResearchGate</a>）。标签传播、谱聚类、扩散映射都建在同一根 Laplacian 上，图 Laplacian 正是流形上 Laplace–Beltrami 算子（扩散生成元）的离散逼近。近年工作还把它推向动态批量更新（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2604.06596\">DynLP, arXiv:2604.06596</a>）与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>-Laplacian 正则化的连续极限收敛率分析（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2310.12691\">arXiv:2310.12691</a>）。位势论在这里以&quot;最平滑插值&quot;的身份重生。</p>\n<h2 id=\"边界-位势论止于何处\">边界：位势论止于何处</h2><p>理解一门理论的边界，和理解它的内容同样重要。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>随机增长</strong>：扩散限制凝聚（DLA）、Hastings–Levitov 模型用调和测度驱动界面生长，产生分形；这已进入统计物理与 SLE（Schramm–Loewner 演化）的地界，位势论只提供&quot;调和测度&quot;这一入口。</li>\n<li><strong>多复变与复位势论</strong>：把对数位势换成多重次调和函数、Laplace 换成复 Monge–Ampère 算子，得到 pluripotential theory，是多复变与复几何的工具，远超本 hub 的实位势论范围。</li>\n<li><strong>相邻 hub 的分工</strong>：数值格式的一般理论（稳定性、收敛阶）属于 <a href=\"../../numerical-methods/numerical-integration-differentiation/interpolation\">数值方法 hub</a>；随机微分方程与 Feynman–Kac 的一般框架属于 <a href=\"../../stochastic-processes/applications/sde\">随机过程 · SDE</a>；本 hub 只负责其中&quot;由 Laplace 算子生成&quot;的那一支。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>多项式插值的最优节点（Chebyshev/Fekete 点）取自平衡测度，把 <a href=\"../capacity/equilibrium-measure\">平衡测度</a> 与数值逼近连起来——这是位势论向数值分析伸出的又一只手。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>位势问题的数值求解有三路：有限元（体网格、有源）、边界元（边界网格、无界域）、蒙特卡洛（无网格、高维单点）。</li>\n<li>边界元法直接实现 Green 表示公式，用单/双层位势把边值问题降一维；其稠密矩阵瓶颈由快速多极算法（FMM）压到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，是 20 世纪十大算法之一。</li>\n<li>行走随机球把 Kakutani 公式变成无网格并行算法，在计算机图形学中复兴。</li>\n<li>图 Laplacian 把位势论搬上图：离散调和 = 邻居加权平均，支撑高斯场/调和函数半监督学习、标签传播、谱聚类，是流形扩散算子的离散逼近。</li>\n<li>位势论的边界：DLA/SLE、复位势论、一般数值与 SDE 理论分属相邻领域，本 hub 只覆盖 Laplace 算子生成的实位势论部分。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本章上一篇（数值背后的概率原理）：<a href=\"brownian-connection\">布朗运动的概率联系</a></li>\n<li>边界元法所依赖的表示公式与单双层位势：<a href=\"../boundary/green-functions\">Green 函数</a>、<a href=\"../capacity/newtonian-potential\">牛顿位势</a></li>\n<li>跨库：随机微分方程与 Feynman–Kac 的一般框架见 <a href=\"../../stochastic-processes/applications/sde\">随机过程 · SDE</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"应用与边界：从边界元法到图上的调和函数","id":"应用与边界-从边界元法到图上的调和函数"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三类数值方法","id":"核心概念-三类数值方法"},{"level":2,"text":"快速多极算法：把 O(N²) 压到 O(N)","id":"快速多极算法-把-o-n-压到-o-n"},{"level":2,"text":"概率数值法：行走随机球","id":"概率数值法-行走随机球"},{"level":2,"text":"离散位势论：图 Laplacian 与机器学习","id":"离散位势论-图-laplacian-与机器学习"},{"level":2,"text":"边界：位势论止于何处","id":"边界-位势论止于何处"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"物理应用：静电、引力与稳态世界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/potential-theory/practice/physics-applications"},"next":null}